  "composition_summary": "Preserved the volatile tail unchanged (single user request, no justified repair). Drafted one pure-logic class-22 component pc-transfer-11: it classifies a raw rank value into {kind, rank} with the requested missing/null/exact-integer-7..16/other semantics, using inputs.get() so absence is a valid outcome, exact integer type checks (booleans rejected), and no coercion/defaults/exceptions/imports/host calls. The body assigns result on every branch. This is an unapproved draft; typed-input transport and Monty execution are target interfaces requiring runner support, and no observed tests, submission or activation occurred. The host sink supports class-22 name/description/content; activation and reuse require Q1 and human Q2.",
